 "turns": [
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Right, I'll be quick, because I've got a conference call at half ten. It's the bloating again, after I've had dairy."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Then let's go straight to it. Tell me what happens after dairy."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Within an hour, my stomach swells up like a balloon. Cheese, milk in my tea, ice cream, any of it. And then the wind."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "How long does the wind and bloating last?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "A few hours. Sometimes till the next morning."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Last time we talked about the irritable bowel and the tablets. How have they been?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "The mebeverine, 135 mg three times a day, maybe, I might have that wrong, it's on the packet. And the peppermint capsules, with meals."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "So, 135 mg, you think, and the peppermint capsules. Are they helping at all?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Bit. Not with dairy, though. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any weight loss, or have you lost your appetite?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, no weight loss. If anything, I've put some on."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any blood in your stools, or black stools?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No. None."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Let me remind myself of your past medical history."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Irritable bowel, iron-deficiency anaemia a few years ago, which they sorted, and migraines."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Good. Any heartburn, or trouble swallowing?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, nothing like that. My swallowing's fine."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Let me take your pulse and blood pressure. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Fine. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Pulse 72, blood pressure 118 over 76.",
   "pause": 12.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Normal, then. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Normal. Tell me, what happens if you have lactose-free milk? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Nothing. I switched my tea to lactose-free three weeks ago, and I've been fine on it. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "That's very telling. A reaction to milk and cheese, but not to lactose-free milk, makes lactose intolerance the most likely explanation."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "So it's the dairy, not my IBS. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Possibly both, but yes, the dairy is the likely trigger. I'd cut dairy for four weeks and see."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Cheese is my weakness. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Hard cheeses like cheddar have very little lactose, so you may be able to keep some. Experiment. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "That's good news. And the tablets? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Carry on with the mebeverine and the peppermint for now, and I'll review them when we've seen what the diet does. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Right. When do I see you? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'd like to see you again in six weeks, if that suits."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Six weeks. Fine. I have to go, bye. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Take care. ~"
  }
